{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_55798","headline":"送刘光载归宁 · 翁承赞","name":"送刘光载归宁","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"少年才子喜还家，满袖新诗敌绮霞。\n襟袖凉生归马病，关河秋晓早鸿斜。\n趋庭虽未惊丹桂，问绢何妨赋《白华》。\n莫爲时危翻自滞，回头一步是星槎。\n（同前。\n）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"翁承赞","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_55798.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_55798","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}